  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build 2 Classrooms and Toilets for 700 Pupils.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Agricultural Association (I.A.A) aims to help provide quality education to 700 pupils in Mogni-Kouffen community in Foumbot area who do not have access and support in education. This project will construct two classrooms, administrative office, teachers&apos; toilet, two toilets for female and male children and construct a well with manual pump, to ensure a conducive learning environment for pupils and teachers of GBPS Mogni-Kouffen, in Foumbot, west region of Cameroon.</narrative>
  </description>
